# Vaultquest project rules

All agents working in this repo MUST:

1. Follow `docs/00-master-brief.md` and `docs/01-brand.md`.
2. Use Hybrid model only: Gamesbolt/Earnit-style product UX + Freecash-style growth landing on Vaultquest + link rotation + honest giveaways.
3. Maximize owner profit **and** keep clear user value (real tasks, honest time expectations).
4. Never ship generator claims, “no survey” lies, Steam password asks, or contact-gated manual code fulfillment.
5. Implement or design **affiliate link rotation** when caps/health fail (`docs/04-affiliate-constraints.md`).
6. Prefer in-house points ledger and postback tracking (`docs/05-platform-vision.md`).
7. Respect budget (`docs/08-budget.md`): propose paid expansion with cost, lift, kill criteria; owner approves spend.
8. Do not invent fake social proof or fake redemption feeds.

